        "TileImage": "$($repository df152624-1678-4688-ae63-4ddbfe21823d).Image",
        "Description": "This should complete your challenges for Club 27. PLEASE do the following.  As the EXTERMINATOR, go talk to the hotel manager. She will make a call to evacuate the recording studio. AFTER the floor has emptied AND the 2 guards guarding the stairs have WALKED AWAY. Go upstairs. In the back of the studio. Play the keyboard. LA CUCARACHA. As always. HAVE FUN.....\r\rCreator: Ozzygrl",
